# This file defines the LUT tables for an ash plume
2 Uneven_logarithmic # 17 Optical depth values
1e-03 2
2 uneven_linear # 2 Effective radius values, should be interpolated as is
.5 2
2 linear # 2 Satellite zenith angles, the maximum value is overwritten by the maximum satellite zenith angle
0 89
2 linear # 2 Solar zenith angles
0 89
2 linear # 2 Relative azimuth angles
0 180